, "Dimenzije (ŠxVxD)": "<p>110 x 61.8 x 18 cm</p>", "NAV Sticker Ends At": "2026-03-21 00:00:00", "Akumulirana energija": "25.6 kWh", "NAV Salesperson Code": "DEJANL", "NAV Sticker Starts At": "2026-03-19 00:00:00", "NAV ERP Product Status": "3", "NAV Category ID Description": "TA peći"}', '2026-06-21 03:01:50.756481');
