 Retail Price": "12999.00", "Country of origin": "Kina", "NAV Price History": "15999.00", "Dimenzije (ŠxVxD)": "<p>45.1 x 75.4 x 9.8 cm</p> <p> </p>", "NAV Sticker Ends At": "2026-03-21 00:00:00", "NAV Salesperson Code": "DEJANL", "NAV Sticker Starts At": "2026-03-19 00:00:00", "NAV ERP Product Status": "2", "NAV Navision Sticker Label": "48", "NAV Category ID Description": "Radijatori"}', '2026-06-21 03:01:51.658922');
